ELSE.

  WRITE: / 'Standard Value 5: SAME',
         / '  SAP  :', lv_sap_value,
         / '  Excel:', lv_target_value.

  ENDIF.

ENDFORM.



*PERFORM ADD_TO_BATCH.
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& Form ADD_TO_BATCH
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*& text
